<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cemig nine month net 148.3 mln reais [CORRECTED 20:57 GMT].</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cemig nine month net 148.3 mln reais [CORRECTED 20:57 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to nine months from Q3).</p>
<p>Brazilian state owned Cemig power firm released the following nine month net profit.</p>
<p>			Q3 1996		     Q3 1995</p>
<p>    Net Profit    148.317 million	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: Figure is in Brazilian reais and is not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>Cemig is owned by Minas Gerais state.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413</p>
